    <record name="KeypointDescriptor" c:type="GstAnalyticsKeypointDescriptor">
      <doc xml:space="preserve" filename="src/gst/metadata/gstanalyticskeypointdescriptor.c" line="7">#GstAnalyticsKeypointDescriptor associates a semantic tag with a set of
named keypoints and skeleton connections.  Use
gst_analytics_keypoint_descriptor_lookup() to find a descriptor by its
semantic tag, then use the accessor functions to query point names and
skeleton edges.</doc>
